  },
  {
   "start": 94.5,
   "end": 96.9,
   "text": "Skate like they ain't nothing doing, live life, don't say nothing to 'em"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.9,
   "end": 99.2,
   "text": "Spectators, sideliners"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.2,
   "end": 101.6,
   "text": "Spend their days coming up with sly comments"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.6,
   "end": 104.0,
   "text": "That's psychotic, why tarnish a fly product?"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.0,
   "end": 106.3,
   "text": "Why be mad just 'cause I got it? Hey"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.3,
   "end": 109.5,
   "text": "I may never know, wave to the haters that put me on a pedestal"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.5,
   "end": 112.1,
   "text": "Talk smack, but they really know I'm incredible"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.1,
   "end": 113.3,
   "text": "Unforgettable"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.3,
   "end": 115.9,
   "text": "Young Blue Eyes, the new guy is on schedule"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.9,
   "end": 118.2,
   "text": "Man behind bars, and that's minus the federal"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.2,
   "end": 120.8,
   "text": "Stone giant, what the hell could some pebbles do?"
  },
  {
